          "specs/ijt-11/spec.md": "# Feature\n\n### User Story 1 - A (Priority: P1)\n<!-- speckit-jira pin=IJT-11 -->\n\nBody one.\n\n### User Story 2 - B (Priority: P1)\n<!-- speckit-jira pin=IJT-12 -->\n\nBody two.\n"
